<title>BELGIUM: Topcall makes firm Easdaq debut.</title>
<headline>Topcall makes firm Easdaq debut.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian telecoms firm Topcall International AG made a firm debut on Brussels-based European growth stocks market Easdaq on Friday, starting up eight percent on its initial public offering price.</p>
<p>Around 0730 GMT Topcall was at 3,100 Austrian schillings, compared with an offer price of 2,850 schillings, although bid/ask prices indicated the share could head slightly lower.</p>
<p>A consortium of banks led by InvestmentBank Austria placed around 173,000 Topcall shares in a private placement in Europe that closed July 10.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
